---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
const updated = '2026-10-13';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies Mon Titre de Séjour: none set, so there is no banner to accept" description="No cookies and no banner: the residence-permit, tax-stamp and citizenship calculators remember nothing. Only the site's stability is measured, anonymously and without cookies." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>This site <strong>sets no cookies</strong>, so it shows no banner: there is nothing to accept. Details are in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>The calculators store nothing</h2>
    <p>Whether you cost a card, date a naturalisation filing or check the family-reunification threshold, the values stay in your browser: no cookie, no local storage. They disappear when you close the page.</p>
    <h2>Only stability is measured</h2>
    <p>To see whether a page crashes or a calculator loads too slowly, we use Microsoft Clarity in <strong>cookie-free</strong> mode: errors, loading times, clicks with no effect and scrolling. No Clarity cookies (<code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>) or Microsoft cookies (<code>MUID</code>, <code>CLID</code>); one identifier per page view; inputs masked before sending.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>provider: Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland;</li>
      <li>retention: 30 days for recordings, 13 months for aggregates;</li>
      <li>legal basis: legitimate interest (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>No advertising, no social media buttons, no other measuring tool.</p>
    <h2>Calculator embedded on another site</h2><p>The embeddable (iframe) version does not load Clarity and sets no cookies.</p>
    <h2>Refusing the measurement</h2><p>Block the clarity.ms domain in your browser or with a blocker; everything keeps working. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Updated: {updated}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
